  <NAME>Mapping genomic loci bound to BRD2 in Calu-3 cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>Mapping genomic loci bound to BRD2 in Calu-3 cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>we performed CUT&amp;RUN to comprehensively map genomic loci bound to BRD2 in Calu-3 cells. We also included H3K4me3 and IgG antibodies as postive and negative controls, repectively Overall design: The CUT&amp;RUN experiment was performed with BRD2 antibody as well as the IgG and H3K4Me control antibodies with 1 million Calu-3 cells.</DESCRIPTION>
